## Answer 1
Author: Mary Scherer
Accepted: no
Score: 0
License: CC BY-SA 4.0

I was able to resolve my own problem by deleting a single index. I suspect there was page locking on the index which was causing the undetected locks. Thank you for offering suggestions and leading me in the right direction.

